<section class="ak-section ak-responsible" id="ak-section-6" aria-labelledby="ak-title-6">
<div class="ak-wrap">
<h2 id="ak-title-6">
THE RESPONSIBLE BLUEPRINT<br><small>HOW TO TAKE DANDY LIKE AN ADULT</small>
</h2>
<p>
Kratom is a botanical that rewards respect and intentionality. If you treat it like candy or abuse the serving size, you won't enjoy the results. Here is the exact playbook our team and long-time customers follow:
</p>
<ol class="ak-rules">
<li data-rule="01">
<span class="ak-rule-badge">RULE 01</span>
<h3>
Start Low on Day One
</h3>
<p>
Take half a gummy (17.5 mg) or one 50 mg capsule. Put the pouch away. Give it 30 to 45 minutes to settle in before even thinking about taking more.
</p>
</li>
<li data-rule="02">
<span class="ak-rule-badge">RULE 02</span>
<h3>
Hydrate Generously
</h3>
<p>
Like coffee and tea, kratom can have a mild diuretic effect. Always drink a tall glass of water when you take your serving.
</p>
</li>
<li data-rule="03">
<span class="ak-rule-badge">RULE 03</span>
<h3>
Mind Your Stomach
</h3>
<p>
Kratom absorbs quickest on a relatively empty stomach (e.g., 2 hours after a light meal). If you take it immediately after a heavy steak dinner, effects will be delayed and muted.
</p>
</li>
<li data-rule="04">
<span class="ak-rule-badge">RULE 04</span>
<h3>
The Golden Rhythm: Take Routine Breaks
</h3>
<p>
Kratom is meant for your busy workdays, tough workouts, or deliberate weekend unwinds—<strong>not</strong> for mindless 24/7 consumption. If you take it every single day without pause, your body will build tolerance and the magic fades. We recommend keeping it occasional, taking 2–3 days off every week, and never exceeding the label serving.
</p>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>
